                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wafu wako wataishi, maiti zangu zitafufuka; amkeni, kaimbeni, ninyi mnaokaa mavumbini, kwa maana umande wako ni kama umande wa mimea, nayo ardhi itawatoa waliokufa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.26.19",
